&lt;li&gt;Experience developing, maintaining, and supporting third-party JavaScript libraries or widgets embedded on external websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Database &amp;amp; Persistence: Experience with SQL, MySQL (or other RDBMS), and JDBC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web Foundations: Expertise in vanilla JavaScript, HTML, CSS, DOM manipulation, and RESTful APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern Client-Side Frameworks: Applied experience with Vue preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in the Linux terminal, using command-line to troubleshoot systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and collaborative problem-solving skills, with a record of helping teams deliver high-quality software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid security practices: Working with JWTs, guarding against XSS, and preventing SQL injection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
