&lt;li&gt;Experience building applications on public cloud platforms and working with cloud-native or serverless technologies (Google Cloud preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-assisted development tools, such as Claude Code, thoughtfully and effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
