&lt;li&gt;Own production pipeline for all DS jobs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with data science on new pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create monitoring solutions around all aspects of pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale solutions around data volumes, budget, SLAs, infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD pipeline ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help Architect necessary data handoffs to other squads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and mentor best practices within Impact&lt;/li&gt;
