&lt;li&gt;Percona Toolkit (pt-query-digest, pt-online-schema-change, pt-duplicate-key-checker, et al.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux/Unix system administration and performance tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting/Automation: Bash, Python, or similar languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Version control: Git/GitHub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClickHouse, MongoDB, SingleStore (secondary skills)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
