&lt;p&gt;At &lt;a href=&quot;http://impact.com&quot;&gt;impact.com&lt;/a&gt;, we believe that when you’re happy and fulfilled, you do your best work. That’s why we’ve built a benefits package that supports your well-being, growth, and work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong extended health benefits: Health &amp;amp; Prescription coverage, vision and dental care, virtual health care, out-of-country medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance coverage (life, short-term disability, long-term disability, and more)&lt;/li&gt;
