&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;impact.com is the global leader in partnership management technology, enabling brands to discover, manage, and scale partnerships across the entire consumer journey. The platform unifies affiliate publishers, influencers, creators, and referral advocates into a single software ecosystem, powering performance-driven partnerships for thousands of leading global enterprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role at impact.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Marketplace Growth Manager (Technical Operations) is a newly created, technically grounded role designed to engineer visibility, partner discovery, and automated promotional systems across our digital marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of technical operations, data querying, and platform architecture, this position owns the technical workflows behind how brands, products, publishers, and creators are surfaced and promoted. You will be responsible for extracting and analyzing partner data via &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, configuring and styling in-app placements using &lt;strong&gt;HTML/CSS&lt;/strong&gt;, and building automated, rule-based workflows that replace repetitive manual tasks. As the technical project lead for marketplace growth, you will work directly in &lt;strong&gt;Jira and Confluence&lt;/strong&gt; alongside Software Engineers, Data Scientists, and Product Managers to deploy internal tooling and scale platform discovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Please note: This is a technical platform operations role, not a traditional retail buying, fashion SKU planning, or physical store merchandising position).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Query &amp;amp; Analyze Platform Data Using SQL:&lt;/strong&gt; Write custom SQL queries to extract data on partner performance, user browsing behaviors, conversion funnels, and transactional trends to inform placement strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Configure &amp;amp; Style Front-End Placements:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize &lt;strong&gt;HTML and CSS&lt;/strong&gt; alongside platform CMS and templating engines to format, style, and deploy promotional banners, featured directory modules, and in-app partner showcases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect Automated Workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement automated, dynamic partner listing logic, webhook triggers, and automated workflows using modern workflow automation tools and AI suites to scale discovery without adding manual headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technical Project Management in Jira &amp;amp; Confluence:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the technical project owner for marketplace growth initiatives—authoring technical requirements, user stories, and acceptance criteria while managing development sprints and handoffs with Engineering and Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Cross-Functionally with Engineering &amp;amp; Data Science:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate operational bottlenecks into technical specifications, collaborating with software developers to enhance platform APIs, recommendation algorithms, and internal management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute Rigorous A/B Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and measure controlled A/B and multivariate tests across copy, front-end visual placements, and audience segments to optimize selection rates, CTR, and gross platform transaction volume (GTV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain Automated Promotional Calendars:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish dynamic, logic-driven scheduling systems to power continuous visibility across email digests, in-app surfaces, and push notifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and report on core technical and commercial KPIs, including partner discoverability rates, selection rates, automation coverage percentage, and manual workflow reduction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Technical &amp;amp; Platform Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 3 years of experience in technical platform operations, product operations, growth engineering, or digital marketplace systems within a SaaS or multi-sided tech platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-On SQL Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to independently write and execute SQL queries to extract, transform, and analyze relational database data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Knowledge of HTML &amp;amp; CSS:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with HTML and CSS to configure, style, and debug front-end web or in-app interface components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Project Management Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage technical initiatives end-to-end within agile environments, utilizing &lt;strong&gt;Jira and Confluence&lt;/strong&gt; for requirement scoping, issue tracking, and roadmap delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Systems-Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience building rule-based automations, API integrations, and leveraging AI tools to eliminate repetitive manual processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Experimentation Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundation in quantitative data analysis, statistical evaluation, and structured A/B testing methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Cross-Functional Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to communicate technical requirements clearly to developers and data scientists while articulating commercial business impact to executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Business Information Technology, Data Analytics, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Data Extraction &amp;amp; Front-End Styling:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong fluency in SQL and foundational HTML/CSS to manage platform data and front-end promotional assets directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Structured project management discipline to lead cross-functional delivery with Engineering and Product in Jira.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Automation &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive builder mindset focused on replacing manual tasks with automated, logic-driven workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quantitative Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Data-first approach to testing and optimizing platform conversion funnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture Understanding:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive grasp of multi-sided digital ecosystem mechanics and relational data structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working &amp;amp; Hybrid Balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Responsible PTO policy supporting work-life balance, combined with a hybrid working environment out of our Cape Town office (&lt;code&gt;#Li-Hybrid_CapeTown&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive medical coverage, monthly gym reimbursement, and access to 12 fully covered mental health therapy/coaching sessions annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Investment:&lt;/strong&gt; Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) with a 3-year vesting schedule (subject to Board approval).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Fully sponsored access to online learning platforms, including Coursera subscriptions and specialized industry courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Family Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Progressive parental leave policy providing up to 26 weeks paid leave for primary caregivers and 13 weeks for secondary caregivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Office &amp;amp; Technology Allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Financial stipend to equip your home workstation, along with a monthly internet subsidy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#Li-Hybrid_CapeTown&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About impact.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;impact.com is the world’s leading commerce partnership marketing platform, transforming the way businesses grow by enabling them to discover, manage, and scale partnerships across the entire customer journey. From affiliates and influencers to content publishers, brand ambassadors, and customer advocates, impact.com empowers brands to drive trusted, performance-based growth through authentic relationships. Its award-winning products - Performance (affiliate), Creator (influencer), and Advocate (customer referral) - unify every type of partner into one integrated platform. As consumers increasingly rely on recommendations from people and communities they trust, impact.com helps brands show up where it matters most. Today, over 5,000 global brands - including Walmart, Uber, Shopify, Lenovo,&amp;nbsp; and Fanatics - rely on &lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fimpact.com&amp;amp;esheet=54399906&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260120914149&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=impact.com&amp;amp;index=38&amp;amp;md5=c467739484a5a8610aff0747572ac8cb&quot;&gt;impact.com&lt;/a&gt; to power more than 350,000 partnerships that deliver measurable business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role at &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://impact.com&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;impact.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As impact.com continues to scale its global partnership management platform, our product offering and distributed system architectures grow increasingly interconnected. Delivering major, high-leverage software capabilities is no longer the work of single, isolated squads; instead, it demands seamless coordination, dependency management, and flawless alignment across multiple engineering, product, design, and data science teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Without dedicated operational guidance, complex cross-functional initiatives face risks of misalignment, fragmented tracking, delayed releases, and administrative overhead on engineering leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Project Manager (TPM)&lt;/strong&gt; role is established within the Product Operations sub-department to resolve these challenges. By serving as the operational connective tissue across squads, the TPM ensures that multi-team technical programs are planned with rigor, executed with agility, and delivered with predictability. This role is essential for accelerating program velocity, resolving structural friction points, and keeping our R&amp;amp;D teams highly aligned with overall business outcomes and customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Technical Project Manager is a dynamic, highly visible execution leader within impact.com&#39;s Product &amp;amp; Technology division. Reporting directly to the Senior Director, Product Operations, this individual takes end-to-end operational ownership of cross-functional technical programs from inception to post-launch evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The TPM is a &quot;player-coach&quot; of process and program execution. They act as a trusted partner to engineering managers, product leads, and UX designers, using Agile and Scrum methodologies to keep highly complex, multi-team efforts on track.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a unique combination of sharp organizational instincts, deep communication skills, and technical credibility—allowing you to engage deeply with engineers on architecture, APIs, and system dependencies. Additionally, this role champions modern operations by actively leveraging generative AI tools to maximize personal productivity, streamline documentation, and continuously mature the wider TPM playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Program &amp;amp; Delivery Management (40%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the execution of complex, multi-team technical programs, ensuring they progress predictably from early scoping and dependency mapping through launch and stabilization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive agile program ceremonies, coordinate cross-squad sprint reviews, organize program-level syncs, and facilitate joint retrospectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tracking &amp;amp; Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain high hygiene standards for project tracking in Jira (boards, epics, sprint mapping, and active dependency links) and structured, accessible documentation in Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Blocker Mitigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify, track, and resolve scope creep, resource constraints, technical blockers, and team-to-team dependencies before they impact the critical path.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SLA &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Define program milestones, establish success metrics, and own the communication of progress, health, and risk profiles to R&amp;amp;D and business leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Stakeholder &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Alignment (30%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connective Tissue:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary operational link bridging Engineering, Product, Design, Data, and go-to-market/customer-facing business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and execute comprehensive stakeholder communication plans, ensuring alignment on project changes, escalation paths, and key decision logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trade-off Facilitation:&lt;/strong&gt; Host and guide trade-off discussions when squads face conflicting priorities, resource constraints, or architectural friction points, presenting structured, data-driven options to leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resource Balance:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineering managers and product leads to ensure sprint commitments sensibly balance new feature delivery, tech debt reduction, and operational support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Process Maturity &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement (20%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach and support engineering squads of varying maturity levels, helping them refine their local Scrum/Kanban practices to improve flow and cycle time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Objective Post-Mortems:&lt;/strong&gt; Run blame-free retrospectives and post-mortems following major releases or system-layer issues, translating takeaways into immediate process updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TPM Practice Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively contribute to building the internal TPM practice by developing shared templates, delivery playbooks, and standardized metric dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Technical Literacy &amp;amp; Modern AI Productivity (10%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively utilize modern generative AI tools (such as Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, or Copilot) to accelerate daily tasks—such as synthesizing documentation, drafting clear stakeholder communications, and automating administrative program tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strong working knowledge of impact.com&#39;s system architectures, APIs, and cloud infrastructure patterns to credibly challenge timelines, identify technical risks, and participate in scoping discussions with technical leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owned KPIs and Outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;North Stars&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional programs are delivered predictably, on scope, and with high transparency across R&amp;amp;D and GTM teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-team dependencies are identified and resolved proactively, minimizing critical-path slippage and structural friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program &amp;amp; Delivery Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Milestone Predictability:&lt;/strong&gt; Achievement rate of critical program milestones and target launch windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time-to-Resolution for Blockers:&lt;/strong&gt; Speed and effectiveness of clearing cross-team blockers and resource constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Sentiment:&lt;/strong&gt; Positive alignment and communication satisfaction scores from collaborating squads and product partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Hygiene Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jira &amp;amp; Confluence Health:&lt;/strong&gt; Accuracy and completeness of epic definitions, dependency linkages, active decision logs, and release plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retrospective Action Rate:&lt;/strong&gt; The speed at which retro-identified improvement items are actioned and implemented in future sprints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cycle Time reduction:&lt;/strong&gt; Measurable improvement in delivery velocity for multi-squad initiatives through refined dependency planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
