&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep command of Agile/Scrum methodologies, with the practical ability to adapt frameworks to fit squad-specific maturity and organizational contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
