&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tool Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience using AI productivity tools (e.g., Cursor, Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude) to accelerate personal output, draft communications, or synthesize technical data.&lt;/li&gt;
